[
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:0.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:0.2", "PA_tha-ap_407:0.3"], "en": "The Apadāna of the Elder Upasīva Metteyya Chapter 5 I was a brahmin youth named Upasīva, A student of Bāvarī, wise and learned. Having heard the fame of the Buddha, the Great Sage, I went to the presence of the Teacher, the Conqueror. When I had approached him, I asked this question: \"Is there anyone in the world who has transcended all ties? Who has crossed over the flood and is free from craving? To whom shall I offer almsfood today? The Teacher, the Great Sage, spoke these words to me: \"There is one in the world who has transcended all ties; He has crossed over the flood and is free from craving. To him you should offer almsfood today. Then, having heard the Buddha’s words, I took my bowl and robe, And went to the presence of the Teacher, the Conqueror. Having offered the almsfood to the Buddha, the Great Sage, I sat down to one side and asked this question: \"What is the name of this teaching, O Blessed One? By what name is it known in the world? How should I practice so that I may attain peace? The Teacher, the Great Sage, spoke these words to me: \"This is the Dhamma, Upasīva, well-taught by me. Practice it with diligence, and you will reach the end of suffering. I paid homage to the Teacher, the Great Sage, And departed from his presence, joyful at heart. Having heard the Dhamma, I practiced with diligence, And attained the state of an arahant, free from taints. I have lived the holy life, accomplished my purpose, Done what was to be done, laid down the burden. My mind is liberated, free from all attachments; I am cooled, O Blessed One, having reached the goal. This is the apadāna of the Elder Upasīva, Recited in the Metteyya Chapter.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:1.1"], "en": "Not far from the Himālaya,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:1.2"], "en": "there is a mountain named Anoma;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:1.3"], "en": "my hermitage there is well-prepared.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:1.4"], "en": "A leaf-hut was well-constructed there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:2.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:2.2"], "en": "where a river flows with beautiful landing-stairs and is delightful to behold.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:2.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:2.4"], "en": "In the marshy ground many lotuses and water-lilies grow;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:3.1"], "en": "there are pāṭhīna fish and pāvusa fish.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:3.2"], "en": "Abounding in reeds and munja grass,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:3.3"], "en": "covered with fish and turtles,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:3.4"], "en": "the river then flowed along.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:4.1"], "en": "There, *timira* trees are in bloom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:4.2"], "en": "along with *asoka*, *khuddamālaka*,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:4.3"], "en": "*punnāga*, and *giripunnāga* trees.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:4.4"], "en": "They offer me their hermitage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:5.1"], "en": "There, *kuṭaja* trees are in bloom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:5.2"], "en": "as are groves of thorny grasses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:5.3"], "en": "There were *sāla* and *saḷala* trees,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:5.4"], "en": "and many *campaka* trees in full bloom;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:6.1"], "en": "as well as *ajjuna* and *atimutta* trees.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:6.2"], "en": "And Mahānāmā has blossomed;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:6.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:6.4"], "en": "Asanā and Madhugandhī have also blossomed in my grove.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:7.1"], "en": "Uddālakas, pāṭalikās,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:7.2"], "en": "yūthikās, and piyaṅgukas;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:7.3"], "en": "covered with clusters of bimbijālaka flowers.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:7.4"], "en": "For half a yojana all around:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:8.1"], "en": "mātaggārā, sattaliyo,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:8.2"], "en": "pāṭalī, and sinduvārakā.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:8.3"], "en": "Many *aṅkolaka* trees are there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:8.4"], "en": "and *tālakuṭṭhi* trees are in bloom;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:8.5"], "en": "many *seleyyaka* trees are there.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:8.6"], "en": "They have blossomed in my hermitage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:9.1"], "en": "Among these various kinds of flowers,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:9.2"], "en": "many trees shine forth in splendor.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:9.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:9.4"], "en": "By that fragrance, my hermitage is perfumed on all sides.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:10.1"], "en": "There are harītakī fruits and āmalaka fruits.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:10.2"], "en": "Mango, rose-apple, and vibhītaka;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:10.3"], "en": "kola, marking-nut, and billa,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:10.4"], "en": "as well as the fruits of the phārusaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:11.1"], "en": "Tindukas and priyālas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:11.2"], "en": "madhukas and kāsūmāras;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:11.3"], "en": "labujas and panasa trees were there.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:11.4"], "en": "Plantains and jujube fruits;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:12.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:12.2"], "en": "there were many emblic myrobalans and the fruits of the vallikāra tree.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:12.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:12.4"], "en": "Bījapūra and sapāri trees have borne fruit in my hermitage,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:13.1"], "en": "as have āḷaka, ṛṣimudga, and others.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:13.2"], "en": "Then there were many *moda* fruits,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:13.3"], "en": "pits filled with ripe fruit,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:13.4"], "en": "and *pilakkhu* and *dumbara* figs.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:14.1"], "en": "There were long peppers and black peppers,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:14.2"], "en": "banyan trees and wood-apple trees;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:14.3"], "en": "there were many fig trees, too.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:14.4"], "en": "And yellow *kaṇḍupanna* trees—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:15.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:15.2"], "en": "these and many others were in full fruit within my hermitage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:15.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:15.4"], "en": "Many flowering trees have blossomed in my hermitage,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:16.1"], "en": "as well as alūva and kaḷamba plants.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:16.2"], "en": "There are wild cats and mongooses,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:16.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:16.4"], "en": "as well as *ālaka* and *tālaka* birds found in my hermitage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:17.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:17.2"], "en": "Not far from my dwelling there was a great lake of birth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:17.3"], "en": "with clear water and cool currents.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:17.4"], "en": "It is well-founded and delightful.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:18.1"], "en": "There are many lotuses there, both pink and blue,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:18.2"], "en": "joined with white lotuses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:18.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:18.4"], "en": "Covered by mandārava flowers and stirred by various fragrances,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:19.1"], "en": "the lotuses conceive a bud.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:19.2"], "en": "Other kesara trees are in bloom;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:19.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:19.4"], "en": "many lotuses stand with their petals and pericarps fully opened.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:20.1"], "en": "Honey flows from its stalks,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:20.2"], "en": "and milk and ghee from its roots and fibers;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:20.3"], "en": "by that fragrance, it spreads in every direction.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:20.4"], "en": "Stirred by various fragrances,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:21.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:21.2"], "en": "many lotuses and mango-scented flowers are seen being carried along.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:21.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:21.4"], "en": "Many *ketaka* flowers have blossomed, following the course of the Jātassara River;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:22.1"], "en": "and the *bandhujīva* flowers are in full bloom.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:22.2"], "en": "The Setavārī and the Sugandhikā;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:22.3"], "en": "the Kumbhilā and the Susumārā—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:22.4"], "en": "therein the crocodiles are born.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:23.1"], "en": "Many water-snakes and pythons,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:23.2", "PA_tha-ap_407:23.3"], "en": "as well as pāṭhīna and pāvusa fish, dwell there in that lake.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:23.4"], "en": "Abounding in reeds and *muñja* grass,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:24.1"], "en": "covered with fish and turtles,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:24.2"], "en": "and also with water-lilies;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:24.3"], "en": "Pigeons, sun-birds,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:24.4"], "en": "jungle-fowl, and river-dwellers;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:25.1"], "en": "Dindibhas and ruddy geese.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:25.2"], "en": "Pampakas, jīvajīvakas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:25.3"], "en": "kalandakas, and ukkusas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:25.4"], "en": "as well as many senakas and uddharas.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:26.1"], "en": "The koṭṭhaka birds and the white pigeons,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:26.2"], "en": "many tula and camara deer,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:26.3"], "en": "the kāreniya and the tilaka birds.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:26.4", "PA_tha-ap_407:27.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:27.2"], "en": "Lions, tigers, leopards, bears, hyenas, and jackals depend upon that lake for their livelihood.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:27.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:27.4"], "en": "Monkeys and kinnaras alike are seen in my hermitage;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:28.1"], "en": "smelling those fragrances, [they remain].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:28.2", "PA_tha-ap_407:28.3"], "en": "Eating fruits and drinking fragrant water,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:28.4"], "en": "I dwell in my own hermitage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:29.1"], "en": "The eṇī deer, wild boars,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:29.2"], "en": "spotted deer, small animals,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:29.3"], "en": "fireflies, and glowworms—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:29.4"], "en": "They dwell in my hermitage:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:30.1"], "en": "swans, cranes, and peacocks,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:30.2"], "en": "as well as sparrows and cuckoos.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:30.3"], "en": "There were many cats there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:30.4"], "en": "as well as scorpions and centipedes;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:31.1"], "en": "and likewise piśācas and dānavas.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:31.2"], "en": "Many kumbhaṇḍas and rakkhasas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:31.3"], "en": "as well as garuḷas and pannagas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:31.4"], "en": "dwell in my hermitage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:32.1"], "en": "The sages of great power,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:32.2"], "en": "with peaceful minds and concentrated,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:32.3"], "en": "all carry water-pots.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:32.4", "PA_tha-ap_407:32.5"], "en": "Wearing deerskins as upper garments and burdened with loads of matted hair,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:32.6"], "en": "they dwell in my hermitage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:33.1"], "en": "Looking ahead only the distance of a yoke,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:33.2"], "en": "prudent and living in peace,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:33.3"], "en": "they are content with gain and loss alike.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:33.4"], "en": "They dwell in my hermitage,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:34.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:34.2"], "en": "shaking their bark garments and slapping their deerskin robes.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:34.3"], "en": "Supported by the Sabala spirits,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:34.4"], "en": "they then travel through the sky;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:35.1"], "en": "they do not fetch water.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:35.2"], "en": "Or wood for the fire;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:35.3"], "en": "and she herself was fully ordained—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:35.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of that miracle.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:36.1"], "en": "Taking up iron cauldrons,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:36.2", "PA_tha-ap_407:36.3"], "en": "they dwell in the midst of the forest like great elephants, mighty tuskers.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:36.4"], "en": "Like a fearless lion,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:37.1"], "en": "some go to Goyāna,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:37.2"], "en": "others to Pubbavideha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:37.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:37.4"], "en": "And others, relying on their own strength, went to Uttarakuru;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:38.1"], "en": "having brought back alms from there, they returned.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:38.2"], "en": "They enjoy [the offerings] together,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:38.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:38.4"], "en": "as all those of great power and composure depart.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:39.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:39.2"], "en": "Then the forest resounded with the sound of antelope skins; such,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:39.3"], "en": "O Great Hero, were your [companions].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:39.4"], "en": "My disciples possess fierce ascetic heat.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:40.1"], "en": "Surrounded by them,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:40.2"], "en": "I dwell in my own hermitage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:40.3"], "en": "Satisfied by their own deeds,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:40.4"], "en": "disciplined and gathered together,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:41.1"], "en": "they have brought me joy.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:41.2"], "en": "Those who aspire to their own deeds,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:41.3"], "en": "who are virtuous and prudent,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:41.4"], "en": "and skilled in the immeasurables.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:42.1"], "en": "Padumuttara, the knower of the world,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:42.2"], "en": "the recipient of offerings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:42.3"], "en": "having understood the proper time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:42.4"], "en": "The Guide approached.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:43.1"], "en": "Having approached, the Fully Awakened One,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:43.2"], "en": "the ardent and wise Sage, [sat down].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:43.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:43.4"], "en": "Taking up his bowl, the Fully Awakened One came to me for alms.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:44.1"], "en": "To the Great Hero who had approached,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:44.2", "PA_tha-ap_407:44.3"], "en": "Having prepared a grass mat for the supreme leader of those born from water,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:44.4"], "en": "I scattered *sāla* flowers over him.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:45.1"], "en": "Having seated the Fully Awakened One,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:45.2"], "en": "joyful and with a heart moved by spiritual urgency,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:45.3"], "en": "he quickly ascended the mountain.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:45.4"], "en": "I climbed up and gathered it;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:46.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:46.2"], "en": "having taken a jarful of the *panasa* fruit, which is as fragrant as the scent of the gods, I brought it back.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:46.3"], "en": "Having placed it upon my shoulder,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:46.4"], "en": "I approached the Leader;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:47.1"], "en": "having given the fruit to the Buddha, I [proceeded].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:47.2"], "en": "Anointing myself with fragrant unguents,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:47.3"], "en": "with a clear mind and joyful heart,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:47.4"], "en": "I paid homage to the Supreme Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:48.1"], "en": "Padumuttara, the knower of the world,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:48.2"], "en": "the receiver of offerings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:48.3"], "en": "sat in the midst of the sages.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:48.4"], "en": "He spoke these verses:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:49.1"], "en": "“He who gave me fruit and a gourd,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:49.2"], "en": "and also a seat to me;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:49.3"], "en": "I shall praise him;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:49.4"], "en": "listen as I speak.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:50.1"], "en": "Whether in the village or in the forest,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:50.2"], "en": "In mountain caves or in grottoes;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:50.3"], "en": "having known his mind,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:50.4"], "en": "food will be produced.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:51.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:51.2"], "en": "Whether born in the world of the gods or among humans,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:51.3"], "en": "this person [is provided] with food and clothing.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:51.4"], "en": "He will bring satisfaction to the assembly.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:52.1"], "en": "Whichever womb he is reborn into—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:52.2"], "en": "whether as a deity or as a human—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:52.3"], "en": "Having become one of unshakable wealth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:52.4", "PA_tha-ap_407:53.1"], "en": "this person will wander through existence for thirty thousand aeons.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:53.2"], "en": "He will delight in the world of the gods;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:53.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:53.4"], "en": "and a thousand times he will become a universal monarch, a wheel-turning king.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:54.1", "PA_tha-ap_407:54.2"], "en": "And seventy-one times he will exercise sovereignty over the gods,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:54.3"], "en": "and he will possess extensive regional sovereignty.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:54.4"], "en": "Incalculable by calculation.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:55.1"], "en": "In a hundred thousand aeons,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:55.2"], "en": "he will be born in the Okkāka clan.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:55.3", "PA_tha-ap_407:55.4"], "en": "One named Gotama by clan will become a teacher in the world;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:56.1"], "en": "he shall be an heir to his teachings.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:56.2"], "en": "Born from the heart, fashioned by the Dhamma;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:56.4"], "en": "having fully understood all taints,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:56.5"], "en": "he will dwell free from taints.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:57.1"], "en": "A gain well-obtained has been gained by me,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:57.2"], "en": "that I have seen the Leader;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:57.3"], "en": "the threefold knowledge has been attained.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:57.4"], "en": "This is the teaching of the Buddha:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:58.1"], "en": "whether in a village or in the forest,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:58.2"], "en": "in mountain slopes or in caves;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:58.3"], "en": "Knowing my intention,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:58.4"], "en": "food is always provided for me;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:59.1"], "en": "the defilements have been burnt away by me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:59.2"], "en": "...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:59.3"], "en": "I dwell free from taints.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:60.1"], "en": "Welcome indeed has come to me!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:60.2"], "en": "...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:60.3"], "en": "the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:61.1"], "en": "The four analytical knowledges (paṭisambhidā) are attained.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:61.2"], "en": "\"...pe...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:61.3"], "en": "the Buddha's teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:62.1"], "en": "Thus indeed did the venerable elder Upasīva speak these verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_407:63.1"], "en": "The legend of the Elder Upasīva is the fifth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
]
